{"seq":2,"slug":"rich-clipboard","title":"富内容与多格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-clipboard-dragdrop/clipboard/rich-clipboard","wordCount":1142,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"富内容与多格式\">富内容与多格式</h1><p>「复制一张图」「复制带格式的表格，粘到 Excel 还是表格、粘到记事本还是文本」——这些需求一旦超出纯字符串，就进入 <code>ClipboardItem</code> 的领地。富内容剪贴板的核心难点不在于「能不能写图片」，而在于两个反直觉的约束：一份内容要打包多种格式让不同接收方各取所需，以及——尤其在 Safari 上——必须用「惰性 Promise」来填充这些格式，否则在用户手势过期后写入就会失败。本篇专讲这两块，把复制做到「在 Word、Figma、别的网页里都粘得对」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-clipboarditem-是多格式容器\">核心概念：ClipboardItem 是多格式容器</h2><p><code>ClipboardItem</code> 不是「一段数据」，而是「同一份内容的多个格式表示的容器」。它的构造接收一个对象，键是 MIME 类型，值是该格式的 Blob（或解析为 Blob 的 Promise）。写入时把若干 <code>ClipboardItem</code> 放进数组传给 <code>write</code>，读取时 <code>read</code> 还你一个 <code>ClipboardItem</code> 数组。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[一份富内容&lt;br/&gt;加粗的季度报告] --&gt; B[ClipboardItem]&#10;  B --&gt; C[text/plain&lt;br/&gt;季度报告]&#10;  B --&gt; D[text/html&lt;br/&gt;b 季度报告 /b]&#10;  B --&gt; E[image/png&lt;br/&gt;可选: 渲染快照]&#10;  B --&gt; F[navigator.clipboard.write 数组]&#10;  F --&gt; G[记事本取 plain]&#10;  F --&gt; H[富文本编辑器取 html]&#10;  F --&gt; I[图像应用取 png]\">flowchart TD\n  A[一份富内容&lt;br/&gt;加粗的季度报告] --&gt; B[ClipboardItem]\n  B --&gt; C[text/plain&lt;br/&gt;季度报告]\n  B --&gt; D[text/html&lt;br/&gt;b 季度报告 /b]\n  B --&gt; E[image/png&lt;br/&gt;可选: 渲染快照]\n  B --&gt; F[navigator.clipboard.write 数组]\n  F --&gt; G[记事本取 plain]\n  F --&gt; H[富文本编辑器取 html]\n  F --&gt; I[图像应用取 png]</pre><p>这张图是<a href=\"../foundations/data-exchange-model\">数据交换模型</a>里「多格式负载」在剪贴板写入侧的具体落地：一个 <code>ClipboardItem</code> 同时承载纯文本、HTML、可选图片，三类接收方各命中一种。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>writeText</th>\n<th>ClipboardItem</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯文本</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTML 富文本</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图片（Blob）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次写多格式</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惰性 Promise 填充</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web 自定义格式</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"打包多格式-富与纯成对\">打包多格式：富与纯成对</h2><p>写富文本的标准姿势是把 <code>text/html</code> 与 <code>text/plain</code> 放进同一个 <code>ClipboardItem</code>。为什么必须成对，在<a href=\"../foundations/transfer-data-formats\">传输数据格式</a>已论证：少了纯文本兜底，粘到纯文本接收方就是空的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"async function copyTable(htmlTable, tsvText) {&#10;  const item = new ClipboardItem({&#10;    &#39;text/html&#39;: new Blob([htmlTable], { type: &#39;text/html&#39; }),&#10;    &#39;text/plain&#39;: new Blob([tsvText], { type: &#39;text/plain&#39; }),&#10;  });&#10;  await navigator.clipboard.write([item]);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 表格场景：HTML 给富文本编辑器，TSV（制表符分隔）给 Excel/记事本&#10;copyTable(&#10;  &#39;&lt;table&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;姓名&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;分数&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;张三&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;90&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#39;,&#10;  &#39;姓名\\t分数\\n张三\\t90&#39;,&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> copyTable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">htmlTable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tsvText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ClipboardItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'text/html'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Blob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([htmlTable], { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text/html'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'text/plain'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Blob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([tsvText], { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text/plain'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.clipboard.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([item]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 表格场景：HTML 给富文本编辑器，TSV（制表符分隔）给 Excel/记事本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">copyTable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '&#x3C;table>&#x3C;tr>&#x3C;td>姓名&#x3C;/td>&#x3C;td>分数&#x3C;/td>&#x3C;/tr>&#x3C;tr>&#x3C;td>张三&#x3C;/td>&#x3C;td>90&#x3C;/td>&#x3C;/tr>&#x3C;/table>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '姓名</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">分数</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">张三</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">90'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里有个实用细节：复制表格时纯文本用 TSV（制表符分隔）而非随意拼接，Excel 和 Numbers 会把制表符识别成列、换行识别成行，从而「粘进电子表格自动分列」。格式的细微选择，往往决定粘贴体验的好坏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"惰性-promise-对抗瞬时激活过期\">惰性 Promise：对抗瞬时激活过期</h2><p>富内容复制最大的陷阱是数据要异步准备（比如要先 <code>canvas.toBlob</code>、先 <code>fetch</code> 一张图），而异步一来用户手势的瞬时激活窗口就过期了，<code>write</code> 抛 <code>NotAllowedError</code>。解法是：<code>ClipboardItem</code> 的值不仅可以是 Blob，还可以是<strong>解析为 Blob 的 Promise</strong>——你在手势内同步地把 Promise 交给 <code>ClipboardItem</code>，浏览器持有它并等待解析，激活不会因为你 await 而过期。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// ❌ 错误：await 让激活过期&#10;copyImgBtn.addEventListener(&#39;click&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;  const blob = await fetch(&#39;/chart.png&#39;).then((r) =&gt; r.blob());&#10;  await navigator.clipboard.write([new ClipboardItem({ &#39;image/png&#39;: blob })]);&#10;});&#10;&#10;// ✅ 正确：把 Promise 直接交给 ClipboardItem，手势内同步发起&#10;copyImgBtn.addEventListener(&#39;click&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  const item = new ClipboardItem({&#10;    &#39;image/png&#39;: fetch(&#39;/chart.png&#39;).then((r) =&gt; r.blob()),&#10;  });&#10;  navigator.clipboard.write([item]); // 同步调用，惰性解析&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 错误：await 让激活过期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">copyImgBtn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'click'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> blob</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/chart.png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">blob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.clipboard.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ClipboardItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'image/png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: blob })]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 正确：把 Promise 直接交给 ClipboardItem，手势内同步发起</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">copyImgBtn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'click'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ClipboardItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'image/png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/chart.png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">blob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  navigator.clipboard.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([item]); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 同步调用，惰性解析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Safari 对这一点尤其严格——它几乎要求所有非平凡的富内容写入都走惰性 Promise 路径，否则报激活错误。这是 Safari 剪贴板「能跑通」与「跑不通」的分水岭之一，更多 WebKit 专属差异见<a href=\"../practice/cross-browser-clipboard\">跨浏览器兼容</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"读取富内容-遍历-types-取-blob\">读取富内容：遍历 types 取 Blob</h2><p>读取侧与写入对称：<code>read()</code> 给你 <code>ClipboardItem[]</code>，每个 item 用 <code>types</code> 数组告诉你它有哪些格式，再用 <code>getType</code> 异步取出 Blob。读富内容的标准模式是按优先级探测 <code>types</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"async function readRich() {&#10;  const items = await navigator.clipboard.read();&#10;  for (const item of items) {&#10;    if (item.types.includes(&#39;image/png&#39;)) {&#10;      const blob = await item.getType(&#39;image/png&#39;);&#10;      return { kind: &#39;image&#39;, blob };&#10;    }&#10;    if (item.types.includes(&#39;text/html&#39;)) {&#10;      const blob = await item.getType(&#39;text/html&#39;);&#10;      return { kind: &#39;html&#39;, html: await blob.text() }; // 注意：须净化后再用&#10;    }&#10;    if (item.types.includes(&#39;text/plain&#39;)) {&#10;      const blob = await item.getType(&#39;text/plain&#39;);&#10;      return { kind: &#39;text&#39;, text: await blob.text() };&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> readRich</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.clipboard.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">read</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (item.types.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'image/png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> blob</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'image/png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { kind: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'image'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, blob };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (item.types.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text/html'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> blob</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text/html'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { kind: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'html'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, html: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blob.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 注意：须净化后再用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (item.types.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text/plain'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> blob</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text/plain'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { kind: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, text: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blob.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>务必记住：从剪贴板读到的 <code>text/html</code> 是不可信的外部输入，直接 <code>innerHTML</code> 等于开门揖盗。把它安全地落进页面的完整流程，是<a href=\"paste-handling\">粘贴拦截与清洗</a>的职责，本篇只负责把它取出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图片往返的实务细节\">图片往返的实务细节</h2><p>图片是富内容里最常见也最易踩坑的格式。三个要点：其一，写入前用 <code>canvas.toBlob</code> 或 <code>fetch().blob()</code> 拿到 Blob，别试图传 DataURL 字符串；其二，浏览器只对少数图片类型（主要是 <code>image/png</code>）有可靠的剪贴板支持，写 <code>image/jpeg</code>/<code>image/webp</code> 的兼容性参差，安全起见统一转 PNG；其三，浏览器写入图片时会解码再重编码（净化的一部分），所以剪贴板里的 PNG 与你的原始字节不完全一致，体积可能变化——这对「像素级保真」场景需要警惕。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// canvas → PNG Blob → 剪贴板&#10;function copyCanvasAsPng(canvas) {&#10;  return new Promise((resolve, reject) =&gt; {&#10;    canvas.toBlob((blob) =&gt; {&#10;      navigator.clipboard.write([new ClipboardItem({ &#39;image/png&#39;: blob })]).then(resolve, reject);&#10;    }, &#39;image/png&#39;);&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// canvas → PNG Blob → 剪贴板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> copyCanvasAsPng</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">canvas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    canvas.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBlob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">blob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      navigator.clipboard.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ClipboardItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'image/png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: blob })]).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resolve, reject);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'image/png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>净化导致的「写入≠读出」背后机制，以及如何用 <code>unsanitized</code> 选项绕过，在<a href=\"../foundations/transfer-data-formats\">传输数据格式</a>与<a href=\"../practice/cross-browser-clipboard\">跨浏览器兼容</a>里有专门讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>ClipboardItem</code> 是「同一内容多格式表示」的容器，键为 MIME 类型、值为 Blob 或解析为 Blob 的 Promise。</li>\n<li>写富文本必须 <code>text/html</code> + <code>text/plain</code> 成对；表格场景纯文本用 TSV 可让接收方自动分列。</li>\n<li>惰性 Promise 是富内容复制的核心技巧：把 Promise 而非 await 后的结果交给 <code>ClipboardItem</code>，可避开瞬时激活过期；Safari 尤其依赖此模式。</li>\n<li>读取用 <code>read()</code> → 遍历 <code>item.types</code> → <code>getType</code> 取 Blob；读到的 <code>text/html</code> 永远不可信，须净化。</li>\n<li>图片统一转 <code>image/png</code> 最稳；浏览器会解码重编码，「写入≠读出」对保真场景需注意。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章上一篇：<a href=\"clipboard-read-write\">剪贴板读写 API</a> — <code>read</code>/<code>write</code> 的基础方法，本篇是其富内容深化。</li>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"paste-handling\">粘贴拦截与清洗</a> — 安全消费读到的 <code>text/html</code>。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../frontend-image-media-optimization/image-formats/modern-formats\">图片现代格式</a> — 为何 PNG/JPEG/WebP 在不同场景各有取舍。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"富内容与多格式","id":"富内容与多格式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：ClipboardItem 是多格式容器","id":"核心概念-clipboarditem-是多格式容器"},{"level":2,"text":"打包多格式：富与纯成对","id":"打包多格式-富与纯成对"},{"level":2,"text":"惰性 Promise：对抗瞬时激活过期","id":"惰性-promise-对抗瞬时激活过期"},{"level":2,"text":"读取富内容：遍历 types 取 Blob","id":"读取富内容-遍历-types-取-blob"},{"level":2,"text":"图片往返的实务细节","id":"图片往返的实务细节"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"剪贴板读写 API","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-clipboard-dragdrop/clipboard/clipboard-read-write"},"next":{"title":"粘贴拦截与清洗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-clipboard-dragdrop/clipboard/paste-handling"}}